### Task Management API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### Variables - Update these with real values
@taskId = 
@userId = 
@adminId = 

###
### List All Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Create a New Task - Daily
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Clean the kitchen",
  "description": "Wash dishes and mop floor",
  "points": 50,
  "frequency": "daily"
}

###
### Create a New Task - Weekly
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Vacuum the house",
  "description": "Vacuum all rooms including stairs",
  "points": 100,
  "frequency": "weekly"
}

###
### Create a New Task - Once
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Organize garage",
  "description": "Sort and organize items in the garage",
  "points": 200,
  "frequency": "once"
}

###
### Create a New Task - Monthly
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Deep clean bathroom",
  "description": "Clean tiles, grout, and all surfaces",
  "points": 150,
  "frequency": "monthly"
}

###
### Get Task by ID (replace {taskId} with actual UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Assign Task to User (replace {taskId} and {userId} with actual UUIDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/assign
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

###
### Complete Task (replace {taskId} and {userId} with actual UUIDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

###
### Approve Task (replace {taskId} and {adminId} with actual UUIDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/approve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "adminId": "{{adminId}}"
}

###
### Get Task by ID - Not Found (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Assign Task - Invalid User ID (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/assign
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}
